---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Privacy policy — TurnKey">
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-[var(--color-orange)] uppercase mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-10">Privacy policy</h1>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--color-anthracite)]/80 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <p>This policy explains how TurnKey (Grégory Vincent / APFL Unipessoal Lda) collects, uses and protects your personal data, in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and Portuguese Law 58/2019.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Data controller</h2>
          <p>Grégory Vincent, acting through APFL Unipessoal Lda.<br>Contact email: <a href="mailto:gregory.vincent@iadportugal.pt" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">gregory.vincent@iadportugal.pt</a></p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Data collected</h2>
          <p>Through the site's forms, we collect only the data required to process your request:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>First and last name</li>
            <li>Email and phone number</li>
            <li>Information related to your project (business type, area, budget, revenue, etc.)</li>
            <li>Any additional message you share with us</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">No sensitive data (health, orientation, beliefs) is collected.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Purposes</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Respond to your valuation or information request</li>
            <li>Propose mandates matching your search (buyers list)</li>
            <li>Ensure commercial follow-up in the context of a potential mandate</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Legal basis</h2>
          <p>Processing of your data is based on your <strong>consent</strong> (voluntary form submission) and on the <strong>performance of pre-contractual measures</strong> taken at your request.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Recipients</h2>
          <p>Your data is processed exclusively by Grégory Vincent / TurnKey. It is never sold, rented or transferred to third parties.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">We use the following technical sub-processors:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Formspree</strong> (United States) for form reception</li>
            <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> (United States) for site hosting</li>
            <li><strong>Google Workspace</strong> for email management</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">These sub-processors adhere to the standard contractual clauses approved by the European Commission for transfers outside the EU.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Retention period</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Requests without follow-up: <strong>12 months</strong></li>
            <li>Active files (mandates, buyers list): <strong>duration of the relationship + 3 years</strong></li>
            <li>Legal obligations (accounting, invoices): <strong>10 years</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Your rights</h2>
          <p>Under the GDPR, you have the following rights:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Right of access to your data</li>
            <li>Right to rectification</li>
            <li>Right to erasure</li>
            <li>Right to restriction of processing</li>
            <li>Right to portability</li>
            <li>Right to object</li>
            <li>Right to withdraw consent at any time</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">To exercise these rights: <a href="mailto:gregory.vincent@iadportugal.pt" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">gregory.vincent@iadportugal.pt</a></p>
          <p class="mt-2">In case of dispute, you may contact the <strong>CNPD</strong> (Comissão Nacional de Proteção de Dados): <a href="https://www.cnpd.pt" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">cnpd.pt</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-anthracite)]/50">Last update: October 2026</p>
          <p class="mt-4"><a href="/en/" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">← Back to home</a></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
